IT DOES NOT COVER THE VENDORED SKILL PACKS. `.claude/skills/` and
`.agents/skills/` are 215 tracked files of third-party material — Phaser and
fal.ai reference skills obtained from fal-ai-community/skills — kept in the
repository so a session has them without a network fetch. They are NOT this
project's work and are not licensed by this file; each pack carries whatever
terms its own author set (`.agents/skills/fal-redesign/LICENSE` is one such).
No build step reads either directory, and `.vercelignore` excludes both.

